  "id": "filet-mignon-with-shrimp-cream-sauce",
  "name": "Filet Mignon with Shrimp Cream Sauce",
  "subtitle": "Seared steaks finished with a savory shrimp cream sauce",
  "description": "Prepare two filet mignon steaks and serve them with shrimp, shallot, garlic, wine, and cream cooked into a rich pan sauce.",
